  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Başlangıç kodu sahibine her şeyi (silmeyi de) veriyor ve bilinmeyen kullanıcıda `KeyError` veriyor.",
      "en": "The starter code gives the owner everything (deleting too) and raises `KeyError` on an unknown user."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`user_roles.get(user, [])` ve `role_perms.get(role, [])`; sahiplik kuralı yalnızca `read` ve `edit` için.",
      "en": "`user_roles.get(user, [])` and `role_perms.get(role, [])`; the ownership rule only for `read` and `edit`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef can_access(user, action, doc, user_roles, role_perms):\n    for role in user_roles.get(user, []):\n        if action in role_perms.get(role, []):\n            return True\n    return doc[\"owner\"] == user and action in (\"read\", \"edit\")\n\nuser_roles = {\"ada\": [\"editor\"], \"bora\": [\"viewer\"], \"ceren\": []}\nrole_perms = {\n    \"viewer\": [\"read\"],\n    \"editor\": [\"read\", \"edit\"],\n    \"admin\": [\"read\", \"edit\", \"delete\"],\n}\ndoc = {\"id\": \"d1\", \"owner\": \"ceren\"}\nchecks = [\n    [\"ada\", \"edit\"],\n    [\"bora\", \"edit\"],\n    [\"ceren\", \"edit\"],\n    [\"ceren\", \"delete\"],\n    [\"zeynep\", \"read\"],\n]\nfor user, action in checks:\n    print(user, action, can_access(user, action, doc, user_roles, role_perms))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef can_access(user, action, doc, user_roles, role_perms):\n    for role in user_roles.get(user, []):\n        if action in role_perms.get(role, []):\n            return True\n    return doc[\"owner\"] == user and action in (\"read\", \"edit\")\n\nuser_roles = {\"ada\": [\"editor\"], \"bora\": [\"viewer\"], \"ceren\": []}\nrole_perms = {\n    \"viewer\": [\"read\"],\n    \"editor\": [\"read\", \"edit\"],\n    \"admin\": [\"read\", \"edit\", \"delete\"],\n}\ndoc = {\"id\": \"d1\", \"owner\": \"ceren\"}\nchecks = [\n    [\"ada\", \"edit\"],\n    [\"bora\", \"edit\"],\n    [\"ceren\", \"edit\"],\n    [\"ceren\", \"delete\"],\n    [\"zeynep\", \"read\"],\n]\nfor user, action in checks:\n    print(user, action, can_access(user, action, doc, user_roles, role_perms))\n```"
    }
  ],
